      <activity id="671bdc6e-ef28-5a49-ac14-9723c82a4e83" activityNameId="b54ac02e-c422-55ee-993e-07e896640915" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Surface treatment, wood window, opaquely painted, wall opening, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Surface treatment, wood window, opaquely painted, wall opening, at plant
The measures of the window are 1.75m (width) x 1.3m (height). The wall opening is 1.8 m2 (assumption width of frame 0.12m, 2/3 of frame are behind the wall opening). The bill of materials is based on data from 3 window producers.;
UUID: bcde12b1-8b38-3888-966c-fffcc5b39f85
Included are the materials used for the surface treatment (opaquely painted) for a wooden window. Production losses and transport of the materials are included.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Industry data.
Time period: Time of publications
Production volume: na
Sampling: Data survey at 4 window manufacturers in Switzerland. 
Extrapolations: Some generic datasets from ecoinvent have been used.
Uncertainty adjustments: None
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_bcde12b1-8b38-3888-966c-fffcc5b39f85.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
